      "type": "singleChoice",
      "question": "要開啟成讀寫模式，應該使用？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "option-0",
          "text": "O_RDONLY | O_WRONLY"
        },
        {
          "id": "option-1",
          "text": "O_RDWR"
        },
        {
          "id": "option-2",
          "text": "O_WRONLY | O_CREAT"
        }
      ],
      "answerId": "option-1",
      "explanation": "O_RDWR 才是讀寫存取模式；O_CREAT 只控制不存在時是否建立。"
